  "book.abilities.body": "{{interact}} <b>Interact</b>: look at a door, light switch or object within reach.\n\n{{primary}} <b>Manifest</b> (tap): an event your type is allowed, such as an appearance or a sound.\n\n",  // PM_TEXT_AI
  "book.abilities.fuse-hunt": "{{fuse}} <b>Fuse box</b>: switch the power from anywhere. Some types never turn it off, others never on, and turning it on often fails.\n\nHold {{primary}} <b>Hunt</b>: when a hunt is available.",  // PM_TEXT_AI
