  "book.bound": "You are bound to your favourite room for now.",  // PM_TEXT_AI
  "book.evidence-title": "Their evidence",  // PM_TEXT_AI
  "book.haunting.body": "<b>Your urges.</b> Every few seconds the ghost feels an urge, as any ghost of your type does: to touch something, to cause an event, to use its ability or the fuse box. Each one is kept for you to act on, up to two of a kind.\n\n<b>Restlessness.</b> Do nothing for half a minute and the ghost acts on its urges by itself until you try to act again.\n\n<b>Your room.</b> Some urges draw you back to your favourite room, as a ghost always is. Some things bind you to it for a while.\n\n<b>Hunting.</b> When the urge to hunt comes, hold {{primary}} before the next one would. Crucifixes still burn, smoke still blinds you and the cooldown still applies.\n\n<b>Evidence.</b> Your type leaves its evidence on its own, as it always does.",  // PM_TEXT_AI
